##  Experimental Setup for Smart Contract Load Testing

| Section      | Category            | Minimum Requirements                         |
| ------------ | ------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |
| **Hardware** | Processor           | Dual-core CPU (AMD Ryzen 7)                  |
| | Memory (RAM)        | 16 GB                                        |
|  | Storage             | HDD or SSD with sufficient space             |
| **Software** | Operating System    | 64-bit Windows 11                            |
|  | Runtime Environment | Node.js v16 or later                         |
|  | Package Manager     | npm (latest stable version)                  |
|  | Blockchain Network  | Hardhat Network (local Ethereum environment) |
|  | Testing Libraries   | Mocha and Chai                               |
